              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.9.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Heb 9:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko baze babāze isandugu mu giti citwa umushita: uburebure bg’umurambararo bgayo buze bube amatambge abiri n’igice y’ ukuboko uciriye mu nkokora, ubaguke bgayo bube itambge rimwe n’igice, uburebure bg’igihagararo bube itambge rimwe n’igice nyene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uz’ uyomekekw izahabu iramuye imbere n’inyuma, kand’ uz’ uyikīkūzek’ umuguno w’izahabu impande zose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ uz’ uvugutire izahabu, ukūremw’ ibigombo bine vyo kuyitērako, ubitēre ku maguru yayo ukw ar’ ane, ibigombo bibiri bibe ku ruhande rumwe, bindi bibiri bibe ku rundi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ uz’ ubāze iminiho mu mushita, uyomekekw izahabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uheze winjize iyo miniho yo kurerura iyo sandugu mur’ ivyo bigombo vyo ku mpande zayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.8.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Abam 8:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyo miniho yame mu bigombo vy’isandugu, ntiz’ isokōrwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.16.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuv 16:34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.31.18"
