              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ivyah 1:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ uz’ ukore ico guterekakw amatara mw izahabu iramuye; ico gitereko cose, hamwe n’intebe yaco n’umutumba waco, kize kibe igicurano; ibikombe vyaco, bigizwe bga mapfundo apfundikiyekw amashurwe, bize bicurirwe kuri co, bibe kimwe na co. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi kize kigire amashami atandatu mu mbavu zaco: mu ruhande rumwe rw’ico gitereko haze habe amashami atatu, mu rundi ruhande rwaco habe yandi atatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ishami rimwe rize rigire ibikombe bitatu bisa n’amashurwe y’igiti citwa shakedi, igikombe cose kigirwe bga pfundo ripfundikiyekw ishurwe; n’irindi shami n’uko: amashami yose ukw ar’ atandatu ashamitse kur’ ico gitereko abe ari kw amera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ umutumba w’ico gitereko uz’ ugire ibikombe bine, bisa n’ayo mashurwe ya shakedi nyene, bigizwe bga mapfundo apfundikiyekw amashurwe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ah’ amashami ashamikiye kur’ ico gitereko hose ukw ar’ atandatu, haze habe ipfundo ahahera musi ah’ amashami ahūrira bicuriwe kuri co, bibe kimwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amapfundo yaco n’ amashami yaco bicurirwe kuri co, bibe kimwe na co: cose hamwe kibe igicurano gicuzwe mw izahabu iramuye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
